WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Priya Nair>Thanks for making the time. Can you walk us through a typical morning in dispatch?

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Dana Whitfield>Sure. Every morning we rebuild the same puzzle from scratch in three spreadsheets, and by the time the trucks leave it's already wrong.

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Marco Reyes>And then the phones start. Customers call to ask where their delivery is, drivers call because a stop changed. We spend the day on the phone instead of planning.

4
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Priya Nair>If this project is a success a year from now, what has changed?

5
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Dana Whitfield>Trucks leave on time, customers know when we're coming without calling us, and my dispatchers stop being human GPS trackers.

6
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:25.000
<v Marco Reyes>And no more paper. Half our billing disputes are about a signature nobody can find.
